{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And Abraham</b> YHWH at the beginning of the verse. ואברהם ושרה זקנים. ואברהם היו יהיה. ואברהם זקן. ואברהם בן צ\"ט שנה. ואברהם בן מאת שנה. Meaning: even though Abraham and Sarah are old, and \"Abraham was to be\" — a great nation:" "<b>Was to be</b> — יהיה לגוי in gematria ק\". Meaning: when he is one hundred years old, then he will be a great nation. And this is what is stated: ס\"י כ\"ן יבורך גבר:"], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {0 "The opening 'YHWH' appears to be a label for a masorah list of verses beginning with ואברהם; the five cited phrases are the opening words of five such verses, here left unaddressed as in the original.", 1 "The phrase 'ס\"י כ\"ן' is obscure; translated hyper-literally as it stands. Possibly an abbreviated citation or mnemonic."}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:16:27.590633448Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}